## What's next

This is the last chapter. You have base language, list ops, higher-order functions, recursion, drawing, a world loop, entities-as-data, and sound. You can build a game out of a state and a loop. You can build an instrument out of frequencies and the synth family. You can build a text picture out of `text/draw`. Every ingredient in this book composes with every other ingredient — that is Motoi's whole point.

If you want more, `book-of-composition` explores the composer (the round-trip UI kit) in depth, `book-of-motion` walks through animation principles, and `book-of-music` walks through musical form. This book was the on-ramp. Those books are the wide roads.
")
